Package: JointShocks
Type: Package
Title: Joint and Generalized Impulse Response Functions and Spillover Metrics for VAR Models
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Johnson", "Oliyide", email = "oliyide.ayobamij@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Thomas", "Wiesen", role = "aut"))
Author: Johnson Oliyide [aut, cre], Thomas Wiesen [aut]
Maintainer: Johnson Oliyide <oliyide.ayobamij@gmail.com>
Description: Provides tools to estimate the joint spillover metrics of
    Lastrapes and Wiesen (2021, 2025), the joint impulse response function
    and joint forecast error variance decomposition of Wiesen and Beaumont
    (2024), and the generalized spillover index, generalized impulse
    response function, and generalized forecast error variance
    decomposition of Diebold and Yilmaz (2012, 2014) and Koop, Pesaran, and
    Potter (1996) / Pesaran and Shin (1998), for vector autoregressive (VAR)
    models, over both full-sample and rolling-window applications.
